        <strong>THE SHORT ANSWER</strong>
        <p>The cost of a roofing lead is useful, but it does not tell you whether your marketing is profitable. Roofing contractors should connect advertising spend to lead quality, inspections, estimates, sold jobs and gross profit before making budget decisions.</p>
      </div>

