<section class="lf-article-section">
        <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
        <h3>What is a good cost per roofing lead?</h3><p>There is no universal figure. Assess the cost relative to project type, qualification rate, close rate, margins and acquisition capacity.</p>
<h3>Are exclusive roofing leads worth more?</h3><p>Exclusivity may reduce direct competition for a prospect, but does not guarantee a suitable project or successful sale.</p>
<h3>Is roofing ROAS the same as ROI?</h3><p>No. ROAS compares attributed revenue with advertising spend. Profit-based ROI accounts for costs and the resulting economic return.</p>
